{"3963060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Celestial Lumina", "steam_appid": 3963060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick up your sword as Evan, prince of the last kingdom with life within its borders. Embark upon an epic voyage to discover the hidden secrets behind the walls of the palace you've known since childhood. Test your mettle against enemies who have fallen to evil--pawns in the war between light and darkness. Only light can pierce the parasitical darkness, and only you can wield it.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/bf501a5f24161cda3da9fead208cb99d.avif?t=1787656974\" width=1482 height=445 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Explore</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark upon an epic quest to restore light to the world by climbing through a contrasting set of environments in <i>Celestial Lumina</i>, a hand-crafted, 2D Pixel Art Metroidvania. Climb from the roots of the earth to the dystopian ruins of a once-great empire, expanding your arsenal of abilities to battle against the Darkness. Each new area brings added movement, tools, and secrets. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/454f665c704db8ac24047fa0d95bae68.poster.avif?t=1787656974\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/454f665c704db8ac24047fa0d95bae68.webm?t=1787656974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/454f665c704db8ac24047fa0d95bae68.mp4?t=1787656974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Fight</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find various elemental items and transform your sword into an elemental blade fit for a warrior. Fire, lightning, and wind are yours to command. Uncover deep deposits of ores and enlist the help of smiths to forge your weapon into a ray of light, able to pierce the darkest night. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/4f4e136c34975f92ac11b3a477ead9a4.avif?t=1787656974\" width=1560 height=689 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Journey</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock powerful abilities that evolve to suit your needs. Face off against formidable foes, threatening all existence. Encounter a colorful cast of characters, each willing to help you or hurt you. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/a8724608683e5d1435cd5734976158c0.avif?t=1787656974\" width=1501 height=835 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>RISE</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Darkness reigns.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world is enshrouded by evil.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Only one can restore the light. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World of Celestial Lumina invites you to embark upon this quest. Bring back the light, or die trying.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Celestial Lumina and join the ascent.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick up your sword as Evan, prince of the last kingdom with life within its borders. Embark upon an epic voyage to discover the hidden secrets behind the walls of the palace you've known since childhood. Test your mettle against enemies who have fallen to evil--pawns in the war between light and darkness. Only light can pierce the parasitical darkness, and only you can wield it.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/bf501a5f24161cda3da9fead208cb99d.avif?t=1787656974\" width=1482 height=445 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Explore</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark upon an epic quest to restore light to the world by climbing through a contrasting set of environments in <i>Celestial Lumina</i>, a hand-crafted, 2D Pixel Art Metroidvania. Climb from the roots of the earth to the dystopian ruins of a once-great empire, expanding your arsenal of abilities to battle against the Darkness. Each new area brings added movement, tools, and secrets. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/454f665c704db8ac24047fa0d95bae68.poster.avif?t=1787656974\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/454f665c704db8ac24047fa0d95bae68.webm?t=1787656974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/454f665c704db8ac24047fa0d95bae68.mp4?t=1787656974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Fight</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find various elemental items and transform your sword into an elemental blade fit for a warrior. Fire, lightning, and wind are yours to command. Uncover deep deposits of ores and enlist the help of smiths to forge your weapon into a ray of light, able to pierce the darkest night. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/4f4e136c34975f92ac11b3a477ead9a4.avif?t=1787656974\" width=1560 